Whom will you choose, Ritsu?!

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:52.210
Now, Ritsu-sama, your decision!

00:17:54.390 --> 00:17:55.870
I refuse!

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:58.450
I don't plan on playing 
along with this farce!

00:17:58.450 --> 00:18:00.390
You can't even make up your mind about this?

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:04.570
How long are you planning to 
play along with this yourself?

00:18:04.570 --> 00:18:06.240
You've started to notice, right?

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:07.870
That this isn't your real self!

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:12.900
Spineless men like you are the ones I—

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:16.610
Hey, did her personality just shift?

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:18.070
You're a man, aren't you?

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:20.530
Make a decision!

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:38.130
I'm sorry.

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:45.320
I'm sorry.

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:47.270
I'm sorry.

00:18:49.280 --> 00:18:50.560
Tak-kun...

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:52.770
She's remembered!

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:01.980
I won't let go of you ever again!

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:11.750
Oh! Kotono-san, you're the best!

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:15.400
This match is now settled!

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:18.840
The winner of this competition 
is Kashiwaba Kotono-sama!

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:21.310
Hey, what's going on here?!

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:24.200
By my guess, many of the men were moved

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:27.040
by Kotono-sama's motherly 
display in the competition.

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:30.880
Why is my score zero when 
you have a vote, too?!

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:34.190
Since you were born the 
heiress to a wealthy family,

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:38.000
I, Toshizo, elected to cast my vote for 
Kotono-sama, because losing everything

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:42.010
would further hone your beauty, Mirei-sama.

00:19:42.730 --> 00:19:44.140
Silence!

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:45.970
I'm extremely and humbly delighted!

00:19:45.970 --> 00:19:49.120
You men are all idiots, every one!

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:52.080
That's right. They're all idiots.

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:57.050
Even so, there are some men you can't leave.

00:19:57.050 --> 00:20:00.840
Huh? You mean this man called Tak-kun?

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:03.380
Even if you return to the 
real world where he waits,

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:06.000
the only thing waiting for you is despair.

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:07.140
What a stupid woman!

00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:13.690
Even if a darkness full of nothing 
but despair is all that awaits me...

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:19.480
Even if it's a hell where I can't 
escape this pain tearing me apart...

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:25.110
Even if that place is Hell itself,

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:27.880
I...

00:20:28.730 --> 00:20:30.910
I want to return to reality!

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:35.420
Kotono!

00:20:35.800 --> 00:20:38.170
Let out the cry from your heart!

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:41.340
I want to return to reality and see Tak-kun!

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:45.300
Go live!

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:03.930
Catharsis effect?!

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:05.070
Wow!

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:09.780
Well, isn't this interesting.

00:21:09.780 --> 00:21:13.240
<i>So, since you're here,</i>

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:21.040
<i>I want you to play your harmony for me.</i>

00:21:19.620 --> 00:21:21.840
I'm sorry, Mother.

00:21:21.040 --> 00:21:24.600
<i>It's like a brilliant ocean,</i>

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:32.250
<i>the spilling colors melting away.</i>

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:26.050
Huh?

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:35.470
<i>Close your eyes. Close your eyes.</i>

00:21:35.470 --> 00:21:39.130
<i>It's all right now.</i>

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:54.550
What is happening here?!

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:29.120
Do you know why humans 
have their eyes in front?

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:40.980
<b>Looking forward doesn't equal progress on its own. 
Understanding one's situation is also an important step.</b>

00:23:29.120 --> 00:23:30.620
So they can live life looking forward!

00:23:30.620 --> 00:23:31.690
Are you sure about that?

00:23:31.690 --> 00:23:32.970
Ah, it's the guy spouting aphorisms!

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:34.990
Looking forward doesn't 
equal progress on its own.

00:23:34.990 --> 00:23:37.020
Understanding one's situation 
is also an important step.

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:39.660
By the way, the right joystick 
controls the camera so you can view

00:23:38.240 --> 00:23:40.980
<b>Huh? A tutorial? This late?</b>

00:23:39.660 --> 00:23:40.980
and understand your situation.
